post-it: Visual artifacting
symptoms:
	Garbled picture
		shows: from the moment the computer starts, coloured blocks and torn lines flicker over the picture
checks:
	Picture is clean from power-on
		shows: coloured blocks and torn lines flicker over it
	GPU heatsink is unmarked
		shows: in the Workview, the GPU's heatsink is scorched
hardware steps:
	Remove the computer shell
	Take out the GPU, throw it in the trash
	Get a new GPU from storage
	Install the GPU
	Remount the shell
